  ],
  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference open-source clinical NLP platform for extracting structured knowledge from unstructured clinical text. Originally from Mayo Clinic, now an Apache top-level project. Supports SNOMED-CT, RxNorm, FHIR, and HL7 CDA. Apache 2.0, v6.0.0 (Sept 2024), modular UIMA architecture. Widely used in clinical research and EHR analytics pipelines. Complements MedCAT in the MACH catalog: cTAKES is the established rule-based + ML pipeline; MedCAT is the modern transformer-based NER/linking tool.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-14",
